---
---
<section class="pt-16 sm:pt-20 pb-8 bg-white overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 space-y-10">
    
    <!-- Top Two-Column Header -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start">
      
      <!-- Left Column: Tag & Main Heading -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-3">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-widest text-jimaco-orange font-display">
            NUESTRA ESENCIA
          </span>
          <span class="w-8 h-[2px] bg-jimaco-orange inline-block"></span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-[#0B1E02] tracking-tight leading-[1.15]">
          Engranando futuro juntos, impulsando el desarrollo.
        </h2>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Lead Paragraph & Description -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-4 lg:pt-8">
        <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-base sm:text-lg leading-snug">
          En JIMACO creemos que cada proyecto es un engranaje del progreso.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-justify sm:text-left text-pretty">
          Por eso apoyamos a empresas de construcción, industria y energía solar con soluciones confiables, asesoría experta y cumplimiento garantizado.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Full-Width Panoramic Image Card: Campo Parex -->
    <div class="space-y-3">
      <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-gray-100 bg-gray-100 relative group">
        <img
          src="/images/pic-campo-parex.jpg"
          alt="Panorámica del Campo Parex"
          class="w-full h-[360px] sm:h-[480px] lg:h-[560px] object-cover object-center group-hover:scale-102 transition-transform duration-700"
        />
      </div>

      <!-- Bottom Caption with Orange Dot (Exact match to screenshot) -->
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 pt-1 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-gray-700 font-display">
        <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-jimaco-orange inline-block"></span>
        <span>Panorámica del Campo Parex</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- Infinite Seamless Animated Marquee: Calidad . Relación . Confianza . -->
  <div class="w-full py-8 mt-10 bg-white border-t border-b border-gray-100 overflow-hidden relative">
    <div class="marquee-track flex w-max gap-8 items-center select-none">
      
      <!-- Repeated Blocks for perfectly seamless continuous loop -->
      {[1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8].map(() => (
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-display font-bold tracking-tight whitespace-nowrap">
          <span class="text-[#1C6521]">Calidad</span>
          <span class="text-[#7BBE6F] font-bold mx-2">.</span>
          <span class="text-[#1C6521]">Relación</span>
          <span class="text-[#7BBE6F] font-bold mx-2">.</span>
          <span class="text-[#7BBE6F] italic font-semibold">Confianza</span>
          <span class="text-[#7BBE6F] font-bold mx-2">.</span>
        </div>
      ))}
      
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @keyframes marqueeLeft {
    0% {
      transform: translateX(0);
    }
    100% {
      transform: translateX(-50%);
    }
  }

  .marquee-track {
    display: flex;
    width: max-content;
    animation: marqueeLeft 28s linear infinite;
    will-change: transform;
  }

  .marquee-track:hover {
    animation-play-state: paused;
  }
</style>
